# Admin shell cascade load

## Intent

After login, show **stable shell** (sidebar + header) immediately; lazy page content loads inside `ShellOutlet` with `ShellPageSkeleton`. Do not blank the whole app on page chunk load.

## Do not regress

1. Keep nested `<Suspense>` in `ShellOutlet` around admin/platform `Outlet` — never rely only on root `AppRoutes` Suspense for page chunks (that flashes away the sidebar).
2. Prefetch home chunk via `prefetchAppHome(path)` before post-login `navigate`.
3. Do not put heavy page imports into layout modules (layouts stay eager/light).
